    family-names: Headley
type: software
version: "1.0.2"
date-released: 2026-11-26
repository-code: "https://github.com/hudsonhrh/transport-twistor-stein-release"
abstract: >-
  Lean formalization of Steinness of the transport twistor interior over every
  open base subdomain of a smooth simple conformal disk. Hudson Headley directed
  the project and maintains the release. OpenAI Codex agents developed the
  mathematical arguments, wrote the Lean formalization, helped draft the
  manuscript, and performed the internal review.
